<title>UK: Mar Flotta to load 6.05 mln bbls in 10 cargoes.</title>
<headline>Mar Flotta to load 6.05 mln bbls in 10 cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>March's UK North Sea Flotta programme will consist of 10 cargoes totalling 6.05 million barrels, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>February's Flotta programme was for 5.85 million barrels in 10 cargoes.  </p>
<p>The traders said the March programme is made up of one 500,000-barrel cargo, six of 600,000 barrels and three of 650,000 barrels.</p>
<p>--Mark Thompson, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
